# # /HEXMLPO/
#
# This namespace is for the resources related to HEXMLPO that
# were developed at the University of Twente, the Netherlands.
#
# ## Citation
#
# HEXMLPO has not been published, but is based on XMLPO,
# which was published in this paper:
#
# Xhani, D., Rebelo Moreira, J. L., Van Sinderen, M., &
# Ferreira Pires, L. (2024). XMLPO: An Ontology for
# Explainable Machine Learning Pipeline. In C. Trojahn,
# D. Porello, & P. P. F. Barcelos (Eds.), Frontiers in
# Artificial Intelligence and Applications. IOS Press.
# https://doi.org/10.3233/FAIA241306
#
